    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Stand is a top-down shooting game that combines light Roguelite with construction elements. You can play as a soldier by yourself or with your friends, and use a variety of weapons and props to repel endless enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gun arsenal: from shotguns to flamethrowers, pigeon + shooting, from scraping to invincibility, directly addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 talent combinations: match different talents and weapons according to your preferences to unlock different surprise experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >86 battlefield relics: defeat various ferocious monsters, choose the relics that suit you, and experience the instantly powerful feeling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support LAN connection: pick up guns, call friends, and blow up monsters together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at any time: 10-20 minutes a game, come to an exciting lunch break adventure at any time!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Stand is a top-down shooting game that combines light Roguelite with construction elements. You can play as a soldier by yourself or with your friends, and use a variety of weapons and props to repel endless enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gun arsenal: from shotguns to flamethrowers, pigeon + shooting, from scraping to invincibility, directly addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 talent combinations: match different talents and weapons according to your preferences to unlock different surprise experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >86 battlefield relics: defeat various ferocious monsters, choose the relics that suit you, and experience the instantly powerful feeling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support LAN connection: pick up guns, call friends, and blow up monsters together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at any time: 10-20 minutes a game, come to an exciting lunch break adventure at any time!</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a top-down shooting game. You will fight alone or form a team to break through the apocalypse of monsters. By combining random weapons, talents and relics, you can create a unique fighting style and experience the thrill of counterattack from struggling to survive to mowing down enemies!",
